    <name>PhotoQt Extensions</name>
    <summary>Extensions for PhotoQt image viewer</summary>
    <description>
        <p>Official extensions for PhotoQt. The provided extensions are:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>crop images</li>
            <li>export images to different format</li>
            <li>floating navigation buttons</li>
            <li>histogram</li>
            <li>upload to imgur.com</li>
            <li>show current GPS location on map</li>
            <li>quick actions</li>
            <li>scale image</li>
            <li>set image as wallpaper</li>
        </ul>
    </description>
    <developer id="lukas.photoqt">
        <name>Lukas Spies</name>
    </developer>
